# Jak II: Jak's hands on a city vehicle's handlebars or wheel (LIST-0.1.9 items 6 and 7, as jak3_vehicle_hands.sim).
# Run with JAKVR_TEST_CONTINUE=ctysluma-start JAKVR_TEST_WARP=bikea (or bikeb, bikec; cara, carb, carc) JAKVR_TEST_RIDE=1
# QUEST_SIM_ALIGN=10000 JAKVR_STATE_TRACE=1: the boot of jak2_wheel.sim, Jak put on the nearest of that type (frame
# 10000), then the same pictures: seated, held, from both sides, turned, let go.
# 0.1.9 (sim s11 vh3b on build 129): the free view moves the eyes but does not turn them, so "held-above" showed only the
# road; now the head looks 70 degrees down while the grips are held ("vh-held-down"): his hands on the bars, under the
# eyes on Jak 3's bikes (the game's handles 37 cm under them, 3 cm ahead).
